{"seq":2,"slug":"interference-mitigation","title":"干扰缓解：合出来打架了，工程上怎么调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/practice/interference-mitigation","wordCount":1961,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"干扰缓解-合出来打架了-工程上怎么调\">干扰缓解：合出来打架了，工程上怎么调</h1><p><a href=\"../methods/ties-dare\">TIES 与 DARE</a> 讲清了干扰的消解「机制」——修剪、符号选举、随机丢弃。但真到项目里，你面对的是另一组问题：这次合并的退化到底是符号冲突还是幅度失衡引起的？丢弃率该设 0.5 还是 0.9？三个模型的系数该怎么分？该用网格搜索还是进化搜索？这一篇不重复机制，专讲干扰的<strong>诊断与调参操作面</strong>，是工程师坐在终端前真正要做的事。机制在方法章、调参在这里，两篇互补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>干扰缓解的操作面可以压成一句话：<strong>先诊断是哪类干扰，再拧对应的旋钮，最后把三个耦合的旋钮交给搜索</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>大概率根因</th>\n<th>首选对策</th>\n<th>相关机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全线轻微退化</td>\n<td>冗余噪声累积</td>\n<td>加大稀疏化（丢弃/修剪）</td>\n<td>DARE / TIES-Trim</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个别任务塌陷</td>\n<td>符号冲突</td>\n<td>符号选举 / 提高该任务系数</td>\n<td>TIES-Elect Sign</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整体变糊、输出退化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 过大离盆地</td>\n<td>调小全局缩放</td>\n<td>任务算术缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强模型独大、其余失声</td>\n<td>范数差异悬殊</td>\n<td>逐向量范数归一化</td>\n<td>归一化预处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三个核心旋钮</strong>：全局缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 管总量、稀疏化预算（密度/丢弃率）管每个向量留多少、逐模型权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 管分配，三者耦合、无法逐个独立最优。</li>\n<li><strong>搜索策略</strong>：超参少（两三个模型、只搜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 与丢弃率）用网格搜索；超参多、配方复杂用进化搜索（CMA-ES），后者可同时优化参数空间与数据流空间，但每代都要评估、开销大，须配代理集快筛。</li>\n<li><strong>常见误区</strong>：只搜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 不搜密度（丢弃率往往收益更大）、在完整评估集上搜超参（过拟合且成本爆炸）、模型过多仍硬合（应改走结构性隔离或多任务微调）。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>merge</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>sparsify</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{merge}} = \\theta_0 + \\lambda \\sum_i w_i \\cdot \\text{sparsify}_i(\\tau_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sparsify</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"先诊断-干扰长什么样\">先诊断：干扰长什么样</h2><p>盲目调参之前，先判断你遇到的是哪一类干扰，对症才有效。</p>\n<p><strong>症状一：全线轻微退化。</strong> 每个被合并任务都比源模型差一点，没有哪个特别惨。这是典型的<strong>冗余噪声累积</strong>——太多小幅 delta 相加稀释了信号。对策是加大稀疏化力度（提高 DARE 丢弃率 / TIES 修剪比例），把噪声砍掉。</p>\n<p><strong>症状二：某一两个任务塌陷，其余正常。</strong> 说明这几个任务的向量在关键参数上与别人<strong>符号冲突</strong>严重，被多数派压制了。对策是上 TIES 的符号选举，或给受害任务更大的合并系数。</p>\n<p><strong>症状三：合并模型整体「变糊」、输出退化。</strong> 常是缩放系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 过大、权重被推离盆地。对策是调小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>症状四：一个强模型主导，其余毫无存在感。</strong> 各任务向量范数差异过大，大范数模型压过小的。对策是先做逐向量范数归一化再合并，或降低强模型系数。</p>\n<p>下表把诊断与对策对应起来，作为排查手册。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>大概率根因</th>\n<th>首选对策</th>\n<th>相关机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全线轻微退化</td>\n<td>冗余噪声累积</td>\n<td>加大稀疏化（丢弃/修剪）</td>\n<td>DARE / TIES-Trim</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个别任务塌陷</td>\n<td>符号冲突</td>\n<td>符号选举 / 提高该任务系数</td>\n<td>TIES-Elect Sign</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整体变糊退化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 过大离盆地</td>\n<td>调小全局缩放</td>\n<td>任务算术缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强模型独大</td>\n<td>范数差异悬殊</td>\n<td>逐向量范数归一化</td>\n<td>归一化预处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三个核心旋钮\">三个核心旋钮</h2><p>干扰调参归根结底是拧三个旋钮，理解它们的相互作用比记默认值更重要。</p>\n<p>第一个是<strong>全局缩放系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span></strong>。它控制任务向量整体加回去的强度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大能力越强但越容易离盆地。经验起点：两三个模型取 0.5，模型多则降到 0.3 附近，然后围绕它小范围搜索。</p>\n<p>第二个是<strong>稀疏化预算（密度 / 丢弃率）</strong>。DARE 的丢弃率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、TIES 的保留比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 决定每个任务向量保留多少改动。密度越低（丢得越多）干扰越小，但丢过头会伤能力。DARE 常从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span> 起步，若发现能力伤太多就调低到 0.7、0.5。密度预算还可以<strong>在模型间不均分</strong>——对更重要的模型给更高密度。</p>\n<p>第三个是<strong>逐模型权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>。给每个任务向量单独的系数，反映你对各模型的偏好或其质量差异。它和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 管总量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 管分配。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>merge</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>sparsify</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{merge}} = \\theta_0 + \\lambda \\sum_i w_i \\cdot \\text{sparsify}_i(\\tau_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sparsify</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个旋钮耦合在一起，无法逐个独立最优，这正是需要系统搜索的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从网格搜索到进化搜索\">从网格搜索到进化搜索</h2><p>旋钮的组合空间随模型数指数增长，靠手调很快失控，得上自动搜索。</p>\n<p><strong>网格搜索</strong>是最直接的：给每个超参列几个候选值，穷举所有组合，用 <a href=\"merge-evaluation\">合并评估</a> 的相对保留率 score 选最优。适合超参少（2–3 个模型、只搜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 和丢弃率）的情形，简单可复现，但组合数一多就爆炸。</p>\n<p><strong>进化搜索</strong>是 2024 年 Sakana AI 进化式模型合并带火的做法，也是当前处理复杂合并配方的主流。它把整套超参（各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、密度、甚至层级配置）编码成一个「个体」，用 CMA-ES 等进化算法迭代：评估一批配方的 score，保留高分的、变异重组产生下一代，如此循环。进化搜索能同时优化参数空间（怎么加权）和数据流空间（层怎么排，呼应 <a href=\"../advanced/frankenmerging\">层堆叠合并</a>），在高维配方空间里找到手工难以企及的组合。代价是每一代都要跑评估，总评估开销大——所以务必配合 <a href=\"merge-evaluation\">合并评估</a> 里的「代理集快筛」压成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[合并退化] --&gt; B[诊断症状]&#10;    B --&gt; C{哪类干扰}&#10;    C --&gt;|冗余噪声| D[加大稀疏化]&#10;    C --&gt;|符号冲突| E[符号选举/提系数]&#10;    C --&gt;|离盆地| F[调小 λ]&#10;    C --&gt;|范数失衡| G[范数归一化]&#10;    D --&gt; H[定义搜索空间&lt;br/&gt;λ / 密度 / wi]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I{超参维度}&#10;    I --&gt;|少| J[网格搜索]&#10;    I --&gt;|多| K[进化搜索 CMA-ES]&#10;    J --&gt; L[代理集快评 score]&#10;    K --&gt; L&#10;    L --&gt; M[选最优配方]\">flowchart TD\n    A[合并退化] --&gt; B[诊断症状]\n    B --&gt; C{哪类干扰}\n    C --&gt;|冗余噪声| D[加大稀疏化]\n    C --&gt;|符号冲突| E[符号选举/提系数]\n    C --&gt;|离盆地| F[调小 λ]\n    C --&gt;|范数失衡| G[范数归一化]\n    D --&gt; H[定义搜索空间&lt;br/&gt;λ / 密度 / wi]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I{超参维度}\n    I --&gt;|少| J[网格搜索]\n    I --&gt;|多| K[进化搜索 CMA-ES]\n    J --&gt; L[代理集快评 score]\n    K --&gt; L\n    L --&gt; M[选最优配方]</pre><h2 id=\"常见调参误区\">常见调参误区</h2><p>三个反复出现的坑值得单独点名。其一，<strong>只搜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 不搜密度</strong>——很多人只调缩放系数就收手，其实丢弃率往往是收益更大的旋钮。其二，<strong>在完整评估集上搜超参</strong>，导致搜索过拟合评估集、且成本爆炸，正确做法是搜索用代理集、终验用完整集且二者不重叠（见 <a href=\"merge-evaluation\">合并评估</a> 的数据隔离纪律）。其三，<strong>模型太多还硬合</strong>——当被合并模型超过一定数量，无论怎么调干扰都压不住，这时该考虑的不是继续调参，而是换路线，比如结构性隔离（<a href=\"../advanced/moe-upcycling\">MoE 化合并</a>）让不同能力进不同专家、物理上不打架，或者干脆回到多任务微调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调参前先诊断干扰类型：全线退化=冗余噪声、个别塌陷=符号冲突、整体变糊=<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 过大、强模型独大=范数失衡，各有对策。</li>\n<li>三个核心旋钮：全局缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>（管总量）、稀疏化预算（管每个向量留多少）、逐模型权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（管分配），三者耦合需联合搜索。</li>\n<li>超参少用网格搜索，复杂配方用进化搜索（CMA-ES），后者可同时优化参数与数据流空间，但评估开销大需配代理集快筛。</li>\n<li>误区：只搜 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 不搜密度、在完整评估集上搜超参、模型过多仍硬合（应改走结构性隔离或多任务微调）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本篇调的机制来自：<a href=\"../methods/ties-dare\">TIES 与 DARE</a></li>\n<li>搜索的目标函数与数据隔离：<a href=\"merge-evaluation\">合并评估</a></li>\n<li>干扰压不住时的结构性出路：<a href=\"../advanced/moe-upcycling\">MoE 化合并</a></li>\n<li>缩放系数的来源：<a href=\"../methods/task-arithmetic\">任务向量算术</a></li>\n<li>跨库延伸——多任务微调作为合并的替代：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/fine-tuning-fundamentals/why-fine-tune\">LLM 微调 · 为何微调</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"干扰缓解：合出来打架了，工程上怎么调","id":"干扰缓解-合出来打架了-工程上怎么调"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"先诊断：干扰长什么样","id":"先诊断-干扰长什么样"},{"level":2,"text":"三个核心旋钮","id":"三个核心旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"从网格搜索到进化搜索","id":"从网格搜索到进化搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"常见调参误区","id":"常见调参误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"合并评估：怎样知道合并真的成功了","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/practice/merge-evaluation"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：mergekit 工作流、许可证与何时别合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-merging-techniques/practice/model-merging-in-practice"}}